WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.839
It is eight in the morning. Léa goes into the bakery in her neighbourhood. There are already three people ahead of her.

00:00:07.089 --> 00:00:10.367
— Good morning, madam! What can I get you?

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:15.185
— Hello! A baguette, please. And two croissants.

00:00:15.435 --> 00:00:20.341
— Sorry, there are no croissants left. But we have pains au chocolat.

00:00:20.591 --> 00:00:24.518
— All right, two pains au chocolat then. How much is it?

00:00:24.768 --> 00:00:27.069
— That comes to three euros forty.

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:33.463
Léa pays with a two-euro coin and two one-euro coins. The baker gives her sixty cents back.

00:00:33.713 --> 00:00:35.915
— Thank you, have a nice day!
